    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d744">

                <pb facs="1082" n="1054" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v03/pg1054"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/10–2054: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Mission at the United Nations</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1954-10-20T15:00:00-05:00">October 20, 1954—3
                            p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Gadel 54. Re: Non-Member Participation UNGA [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">UN</hi>]. Secretary has decided we should
                    let our non-member participation proposal “coast”. He expressed views (1) useful
                    for US to have formulated idea and brought it to attention other delegations;
                    and (2) if idea seeps <pb facs="1083" n="1055" xml:id="pg1055"/> in for year may
                    bear fruit next GA. Secretary also suggested
                        Gadel should make clear to others our
                    belief UN bound to wither away unless it becomes
                    more universal.</p>
                <p>In further membership discussions Gadel should
                    act on above basis. Department will send separate instructions re Japan.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hoover</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
